# Creating an account asks for a name and an email, then a code. No password.
# Run with QA_EMAIL set to a fresh address, e.g. QA_EMAIL=qa-$(date +%s)@example.com
open /sign-up
wait until the Create an account heading is visible
expect a Your name field
expect no Password field
type QA Tester into Your name
type $QA_EMAIL into Email
click Send code
wait until the Enter your code heading is visible
expect a Send a new code button
